      <svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
        <circle cx="5" cy="5" r="3" fill="white"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <span class="hero-eyebrow-text">Skip the sales call. Hire your first employee now.</span>
    <span class="hero-eyebrow-arrow">›</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="hero-headline">Hire, manage, pay,<br>&amp; equip anyone,<br><span class="hero-headline-accent">anywhere.</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-subtext">Payroll, HR, IT, and immigration for every worker type. All in one platform from one trusted partner.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta-row">
    <a href="#" class="btn-primary">
